      descriptionTemplate: "When casting Intro Skill - Skybound Feather, Resonance Skill - Sword Stance Switch: Azure, Resonance Skill - Sword Stance Switch: Feather, Resonance Skill - Sword Stance Flow: Azure, or Resonance Skill - Sword Stance Flow: Feather, the ATK of Resonators in the team is increased by 20% for 20s.",
    },
    {
      id: "YangyangXuanling_s5",
      name: "S5: Take Wing. Take Wing.",
